1
00:04:16,551 --> 00:04:22,551
The tide is turning.

2
00:08:33,103 --> 00:08:39,103
Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom is a action, adventure,
fantasy film directed by James Wan.

3
00:12:49,655 --> 00:12:55,655
Black Manta seeks revenge on Aquaman for his father's death.

4
00:17:06,206 --> 00:17:12,206
Wielding the Black Trident's power, he becomes a formidable foe.

5
00:21:22,758 --> 00:21:28,758
To defend Atlantis, Arthur (Aquaman) forges an
alliance with his imprisoned brother.

6
00:25:39,310 --> 00:25:45,310
They must protect the kingdom.

7
00:29:55,862 --> 00:30:01,862
Arthur, played by Jason Momoa.

8
00:34:12,413 --> 00:34:18,413
Orm, played by Patrick Wilson.

9
00:38:28,965 --> 00:38:34,965
Black Manta, played by Yahya Abdul-Mateen II.

10
00:42:45,517 --> 00:42:51,517
Dr. Shin, played by Randall Park.

11
00:47:02,068 --> 00:47:08,068
Mera, played by Amber Heard.

12
00:51:18,620 --> 00:51:24,620
Atlanna, played by Nicole Kidman.

13
00:55:35,172 --> 00:55:41,172
Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom is a 2023 American superhero
film based on the DC Comics character Aquaman.

14
00:59:51,724 --> 00:59:57,724
Directed by James Wan from a screenplay by David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick, it is the sequel to
Aquaman (2018) and the 15th and final film in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU).

15
01:04:08,275 --> 01:04:14,275
Jason Momoa stars as Arthur Curry / Aquaman, who must work with his half-brother Orm (Patrick Wilson) to prevent Black Manta (Yahya Abdul-Mateen II)
from killing his family and using the cursed Black Trident to overheat the world while searching for the lost seventh kingdom of the seas.

16
01:08:24,827 --> 01:08:30,827
Amber Heard, Randall Park, Dolph Lundgren, Temuera Morrison, Martin
Short, and Nicole Kidman also star in supporting roles.

17
01:12:41,379 --> 01:12:47,379
Momoa pitched a story for an Aquaman sequel during the first film's production.

18
01:16:57,931 --> 01:17:03,931
Wan did not want to rush a sequel after the first film's commercial
success but agreed in January 2019 to oversee development.

19
01:21:14,482 --> 01:21:20,482
Johnson-McGoldrick signed on to return as screenwriter a month later, and
Wan was confirmed to be returning as director in August 2020.

20
01:25:31,034 --> 01:25:37,034
He said the film would expand on Aquaman's worldbuilding, have a more
serious tone, and feature themes such as climate change.

21
01:29:47,586 --> 01:29:53,586
It is a buddy comedy between Aquaman and Orm, and was inspired by the Silver Age of Comic Books with a retro science fiction vibe similar
to the works of animator Ray Harryhausen and the horror films of the 1960s, specifically Planet of the Vampires (1965).

22
01:34:04,137 --> 01:34:10,137
Wan announced the sequel's title in June 2021, and principal photography
began later that month and concluded in January 2022.

23
01:38:20,689 --> 01:38:26,689
Filming took place in the United Kingdom, Hawaii, Los Angeles, and
New Jersey, with additional filming in New Zealand.

24
01:42:37,241 --> 01:42:43,241
Several reshoots took place between July 2022 and June 2023 to alter the storyline while some actors' roles were
reduced, including Heard's, whose involvement was the subject of controversy during production.

25
01:46:53,793 --> 01:46:59,793
Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom premiered at a fan event at the Grove, Los Angeles on
December 19, 2023, and was released in the United States on December 22.

26
01:51:10,344 --> 01:51:16,344
The film received negative reviews from critics and grossed $440 million
worldwide against a production budget of $205–215 million.

27
01:55:26,896 --> 01:55:32,896
The film explores themes of superhero, secret
society, half-brother, sequel, revenge.

28
01:59:43,448 --> 01:59:49,448
The tone is lighthearted.
